# Triple Triad: Bot1's upkeep exiles its Mountain (mana value 0) and Bot2's Memnite (mana value 0, not lesser than 0, so not
# playable). "Play" lets Bot1 play the Mountain as its land play for the turn (CR 305.1); the Memnite stays in exile.
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Triple Triad
Island
Island
Island
Mountain
Island x11

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x9
Memnite
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Triple Triad.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T5 Bot1.Upkeep]
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Exile.Count = 2
! Bot1.Exile.Memnite.Cast
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Exile.Mountain.Play
! Bot1.Hand.Island.Play

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Tapped = false
Exile.Count = 1
